    "lunes, martes, miércoles, jueves, viernes, sábado, domingo",
    "Days are written in lowercase, and the week starts on Monday on Spanish calendars",
    "¿Qué día es hoy? Hoy es martes.",
    "hoy = today, mañana = tomorrow, ayer = yesterday",
    "mañana also means morning: la mañana; mañana por la mañana = tomorrow morning",
    "el lunes = on Monday; los lunes = on Mondays; no word for \"on\"",
    "el fin de semana = the weekend"
  ],
